# Drop installer files here when using NEXT_PUBLIC_DOWNLOAD_BASE_URL=/downloads
#
# 1. Copy .env.example → .env
# 2. Set NEXT_PUBLIC_DOWNLOADS_LIVE=true
# 3. Place files (names from NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_VERSION / filename env vars), e.g.:
#      Apilynx-Setup-1.0.0.exe
#      Apilynx-1.0.0-arm64.dmg
#      Apilynx-1.0.0-x64.dmg
#      apilynx_1.0.0_amd64.deb
#      Apilynx-1.0.0.AppImage
# 4. Or set full URLs: NEXT_PUBLIC_DOWNLOAD_WINDOWS_URL=https://...
